        260.914818,
        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the bonding plate .",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        734.15589,
        198.16845600000016,
        724.9123024640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        719.695446,
        126.04998,
        710.4518584640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To  prevent  electric  shock,  wear  insulated  protective",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        98.82037199999999,
        697.3758743999999,
        368.3070479999999,
        688.1322868640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After installing the bonding plate, perform an electric equipotential test. EVB-201, \"Inspection\".",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        593.39594,
        506.78216999999995,
        584.1520792640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rotate  the  vehicle  communications  connector clockwise  to connect it.",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14000600000003,
        577.9759556,
        368.29035000000056,
        557.2118280640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.00001800000003,
        551.9949716,
        126.04998600000003,
        542.7513840640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To  prevent  electric  shock,  wear  insulated  protective",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        98.82037800000002,
        529.6754,
        368.30705399999994,
        520.4318124640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "gear.",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        72.00001800000003,
        518.15486,
        96.44423400000005,
        508.9112724640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the Li-ion battery heater harness connector . DANGER:",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14000600000003,
        435.53478800000005,
        317.42750519999987,
        411.83075646408844
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There  is  the  danger  of  electric  shock  caused  by contact with the terminals. Be sure to wear insulated protective gear.",
      "page_pdf": 200,
      "page_manual": "EVB-200",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00001800000003,
        398.75477240000004,
        368.3572704000004,
        366.5306568640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow the procedure below to connect the heater harness connector.",
      "page_pdf": 200,
